abstract: "Monitor the Model Context Protocol (MCP) Registry for new, updated, and removed servers. Get real-time notifications via Discord, Slack, Email, Telegram, Microsoft Teams, Webhooks, or RSS feeds. Includes CLI, Go SDK, REST API, and MCP server for AI assistants."
